    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34818" root="فوص" body-key="f">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّفَاوُصُ</span></b>  signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّبَايُنُ</span> [<i>The being,</i> or <i>becoming, separated, one from another</i>]; from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَيْنُ</span>,
not from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَيَانُ</span>: (O, K:) originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّفَايُصُ</span>;
mentioned also [in a different sense] in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فيص</span>.
(TA.) See the latter art.


